# The streetcar never stops for you: standing on the J line's track in Dolores Park, on the straight
# down to 20th Street (the F no longer runs), you hear its bell once as it comes out of the curve
# above, 15 m off (a honk from it), then it hits you at 11 m/s ("hit by a streetcar"), throws you off
# its track to the side, and runs on past you to 20th Street. Only one hit.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 run muni j
cmd 2 teleport -387.17 -362.0 35.8 87.1
run 3400
expect event honk{car=83,robo=false,tram=true} within 2125..2125
expect event honk count == 1
expect event bail{reason=hit by a streetcar} within 2293..2293
expect event carHit{car=83,robo=false,reason=hit by a streetcar} within 2293..2293
expect event carHit count == 1
expect event recover within 2405..2505
expect min car.gap > 3.5 over 2293..3400
expect event muniStop{n=1,you=false} within 3342..3342
